{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the archaic halls of a forgotten temple lies the secret to restoring a lost world. Guided only by ancient mechanisms, you'll journey through a crumbling ruin where nature, technology, and myth intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light of the Ancients</strong> is a calm, first-person puzzle adventure focused on environmental storytelling and laser-based challenges. Each puzzle is a self-contained door to the next \u2014 simple in concept, satisfying in execution. You'll manipulate beams of light, reflect them through mysterious devices, and unlock ancient pathways as you move deeper into the temple's heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, single-player experience designed to be approachable and immersive, ideal for players who enjoy quiet, thoughtful gameplay without pressure or combat. The temple holds its secrets \u2014 it's up to you to bring its story back into the light!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beat The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753680/88a8e2ec70c9f54f86e6480d8134f20ff908d24c.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753680/000e5025516aa9c974bdd3153174e69c5d9305ac.jpg"},{"name":"The Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753680/6ba079a5ee58f9d07a9dce686d9558c047f67044.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753680?t=1751636176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753680?t=1751636176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753680/e92241ee56b011369aacb1a42d9651d568a08237/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751636176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753680/e92241ee56b011369aacb1a42d9651d568a082